{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，楚子伐圈。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔彭生會晉郤缺于承匡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"三、秋，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"四、公子遂如宋。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"五、狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"六、冬十月甲午，叔孫得臣敗狄于鹹。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_107_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_107","textTraditional":"狄者何？長狄也。兄弟三人，一者之齊，一者之魯，一者之晉。其之齊者，王子成父殺之；其之魯者，叔孫得臣殺之；則未知其之晉者也。其言敗何？大之也。其日何？大之也。其地何？大之也。何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}